<title>UK: World Bank sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    15.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.705   PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL 15.JUL.99 AT PAR</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
